WEBVTT

00:00:01.074 --> 00:00:10.557
The initial assessment documents how the patient arrives, before any change. The clinical scales for OCD are listed: enter each score.

00:00:20.113 --> 00:00:24.511
The plus button adds a scale; the minus beside one removes it.

00:00:28.763 --> 00:00:32.940
Then the medications, and a note on how the patient presents.

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:51.478
The stimulation on arrival: 130 hertz, 5 milliamps and 90 microseconds on each side, the defaults for OCD.

00:00:58.485 --> 00:01:04.079
Tap a contact once for an anode, twice for a cathode. Here the case is the anode.

00:01:09.966 --> 00:01:17.011
With two cathodes on one lead, the current can be split between them. Here 60 percent goes to the first.

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.910
Next saves the initial assessment.

